 tu_n:"Training Field", tu_o:"Train the forty maidens before the war", tu_skip:"Skip training ▸▸", tu_done:"Training complete", tu_s1:"Beat Sarbinaz without taking a hit", tu_s2:"All bonus challenges", tu_duel_t:"A sparring duel — not to the death", tu_shieldblk:"Shield!", tu_d_sa1:"Good morning, Gulayim! The maidens have been on the field since dawn — they're waiting for you.", tu_d_gu0:"Then let's begin. Today we train as if the enemy were already at the gate.", tu_d_sa1b:"Ha! Then show the girls how it's done!", tu_d_ays1:"Gulayim, spar with me! I won't go easy on you.", tu_d_gu1:"Come on then, Aysuliw. Strike — I'll show the girls how to slip a blade.", tu_d_aqm1:"Enough sabres for now! To the targets — a maiden's first friend is her bow.", tu_d_sa2:"Your white horse is saddled! Ride through the rings — show them how a batyr rides.", tu_d_sa3:"And now — with me. Everything you've learned, all at once.", tu_d_gu3:"Don't go easy on me, Sarbinaz.", tu_d_sa4:"When have I ever? Girls, make a circle!", tu_d_sa6:"Enough, enough — I yield! My shoulder will remember this for a week.", tu_d_ms1:"Gulayim! Surtaysha has fallen on Sarkop with forty thousand riders! Allayar Bay is holding the walls — he sent me to fetch you!", tu_d_gu4:"Father…", tu_d_sa5:"The maidens are ready, Gulayim. Just say the word.", tu_d_gu5:"To horse, sisters! We ride for Sarkop!", tu_t_move:"Walk to the training dummies with the joystick", tu_t_light:"Tap ⚔ quickly — land a 3-hit combo on a dummy", tu_t_heavy:"The shield stops quick blows. HOLD ⚔ for a strong attack", tu_t_heavyS:"The shield stops quick blows — use the STRONG attack button", tu_t_dodge:"When the red wedge fills — press ➤ to dodge", tu_t_roll:"Double-tap ➤ to roll right through her strike", tu_t_block:"Hold the shield button and block her blows", tu_t_parry:"Press the shield button right as her blade lands — PARRY!", tu_t_jump:"Jump, then press ⚔ in the air — a leap strike on the dummy", tu_t_lock:"Tap the target button to lock on — tap again to switch to Jupar", tu_t_amu:"Press the amulet — a shield of light — and let Aysuliw strike it", tu_t_range:"Go to the shooting line", tu_t_rain:"Press 🏹 — call down the arrow rain on the targets", tu_t_bow1:"Draw the bow, aim and release — hit the target", tu_t_bow2:"Now the moving target — lead it a little", tu_t_bow3:"The far target: mind the drop and the wind — aim for the gold", tu_t_ride:"Ride through all the golden rings", tu_t_duel:"Final test: beat Sarbinaz with everything you've learned", tu_p_move:"Make way, girls — Gulayim is here!", tu_p_light:"Quick as a falcon!", tu_p_heavy:"Ha! Splinters everywhere!", tu_p_dodge:"Like the wind — I can't touch you!", tu_p_roll:"Right under my blade!", tu_p_block:"Like a stone wall!", tu_p_parry:"Parry! My sword flew right out of line!", tu_p_jump:"Like a snow leopard off a rock!", tu_p_lock:"Both of us in your sights!", tu_p_amu:"My blade just slid off the light!", tu_p_rain:"Not one target left whole!", tu_p_bow1:"A clean hit!", tu_p_bow2:"You caught it on the move!", tu_p_bow3:"From that far? Unbelievable!", tu_p_ride:"Like an arrow across the steppe!", tu_b_hold:"The shield holds! Hold the button longer!", tu_b_hit:"Got you! Again!", tu_b_amu:"That's your father's amulet! Let's see its power.", tu_b_miss:"You missed a ring — turn back!", tu_b_horn:"Listen… a horn! From the bridge!", tu_b_ms:"Gulayim! Gulayim!", tu_bonus_pd:"Bonus: perfect dodge!", tu_bonus_rings:"Bonus: every ring on the first pass!", tu_bonus_bull:"Bonus: bullseye!", tu_a1:"Elbow higher! Higher!", tu_a2:"Again! One more time!", tu_a3:"My arm is about to fall off…", tu_a4:"Look — Gulayim is watching us!", tu_a5:"Who took my arrows?!", tu_a6:"Don't watch the sword — watch the shoulder!", tu_a7:"Faster, faster!", tu_a8:"How beautiful the river is this morning…", n_ays:"Aysuliw", n_aqm:"Aqmaral", n_jup:"Jupar", n_ms:"Messenger",
