 s_cv:"The caravan kept more than half of its health", s_sec:"Found the hidden page of the Book of the Epic", sec_found:"A page of the Book of the Epic found!", cv_hp:"Caravan", cv_start:"Stay close to the caravan — it stops when the enemy is near", cv_arch:"Archers on the ridge are shooting the caravan — destroy them!", cv_wheel:"A cart wheel broke! Defend the caravan until it is repaired", cv_wheel1:"The wheel broke! The enemy was waiting for exactly this!", cv_fixed:"The wheel is fixed! The caravan moves on", cv_storm:"A sandstorm! Wolves attack out of the storm", cv_block:"The road is blocked! Break the barricade and defeat the captain", h_leap:"The Wolf Leap (5) can jump over the stakes", cv_d1:"Gulayim, the freed people are exhausted. The carts move slowly.", cv_d2:"We will bring them safely across the desert. Maidens, guard the caravan!", cv_d3:"Everyone is safe. Now it is the Sand Giant's turn!", bk_rein:"Careful! A new party is coming!", bk_back:"They are attacking from behind!", bk_leader:"Their leader has fallen — the rest are shaken!", bk_arch:"Archers! Close in on them fast!", bk_wolf:"Wolves! Stay close together!", bk_done:"The road is open. Forward!", bk_amb:"Ambush! The enemy is all around!", mb_cap:"Captain", f13a:"Gulayim, the enemy is holding the captives in three places.", f13b:"We will beat the guards and free them all. Maidens, follow me!", f13c:"The captain is coming with his party!", f13d:"The village is free! Now we find Qashqir.", lore_sur:"With the help of sorcerers, Surtaysha increased his might and reached an invincible level of power that turned his warriors into wolves. It was not an inner strength, and only pure-hearted warriors can overcome it. But Allayar was not ready for this. That is why he was defeated. His own strength and power, however, he passed into his amulet. Though Surtaysha thought himself invincible, he still feared Gulayim's wrath.",
