 d_ba1:"Gulayim?! Don't kill me! I… bowed my head out of fear.",
 d_gu5:"Fear is no sin, Bayimbet. Betrayal is. Where is the caravan?",
 d_ba2:"Across the salt flats to the river. A sorcerer raised a dev of sand there…",
 d_gu6:"You showed the way, so I spare you. Go back to Sarkop.",
 d_qd1:"Salt and sand are my flesh. The steppe will swallow you!",
 d_gu7:"The steppe is ours. You are foreign sorcery.",
 d_ja1:"Every chain is a slave's cry. Yours is ready too!",
 d_gu8:"I'll bind you with your own chains!",
 d_ot1:"Gulayim… Allayar's daughter! The Kalmyks could not break me.",
 d_gu9:"Otbasqan, you are not alone anymore. Come with us.",
 d_ot2:"Give me back my sword — we ride together to Surtaysha's horde!",
 d_ay1:"The sea obeys Khan Surtaysha. The captives will sink to the depths!",
 d_gu10:"Sea and land alike are a road for our people!",
 d_qu1:"Otbasqan has fallen. Now it's your turn, girls!",
 d_sa2:"I will carve his name in gold on stone. Yours — nowhere!",
 d_qg1:"I stand six arshins tall. Who are you, little girl?",
 d_gu11:"Gulayim, daughter of Allayar Bay. I judge by deeds, not height.",
 d_su5:"Gulayim… I regretted missing you. So you came to me yourself?",
 d_gu12:"I came for my father's blood, Surtaysha.",
 d_su6:"No arrow pierces my helmet, swords bend against me!",
 d_su7:"Tie the chain around your waist! We wrestle — whoever falls loses his head!",
 d_gu13:"Father… give me strength!",
