 ch0:"Prologue", ch0n:"Bloody Dawn", ch1:"Chapter 1", ch1n:"Ash",
 nar1:"At dawn a black cloud settled over Sarkop. Surtaysha, khan of the Kalmyks, came with forty thousand warriors…",
 nar2:"Allayar Bay has fallen. Sarkop has burned. The people were driven in chains to the Kalmyk lands.",
 nar3:"At that hour Gulayim and her forty maidens were on Mount Qiran…",
 nar4:"The black spirit of Qashqir was cleansed and entered Gulayim's amulet.",
 nar5:"Gulayim took up the trail. The Kalmyk lands are far, but vengeance is near…",
